  "prefLabel": "Saf-Mec 301.23 Direct supervision",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-Mec 301.23 “Direct supervision” means daily, on-site supervision by a person having professional knowledge of and licensure in the trade being performed, such that the supervisor is able to respond quickly to the needs of the supervisee or employee.\n\nSource. #10847, eff 7-1-15",
